# Release proof packs are regenerable: `python scripts/build_release_proof.py`
# rebuilds artifacts/release/<run_id>/ from committed inputs (eval/p0_probes.json,
# eval/independent/p0_probe_expected.json, tests/). Traces inside are large, so the
# pack stays out of git and is attached to the release instead.
